<title>IRAQ: PRESS DIGEST - Iraq - Nov 18.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Iraq - Nov 18.</headline>
<dateline>BAGHDAD 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the official Iraqi press on Monday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>THAWRA</p>
<p>- Turkey increases cross-border trade with Iraq.</p>
<p>- Iraq calls for implementing a memorandum of understanding signed with the U.N. to sell oil.</p>
<p>- Vice-President Taha Mohieddin Ma'rouf met in Rome with prime ministers of India, Algeria and Tunisia.</p>
<p>(The above stories were carried by QADISSIYA and JUMHOURIYA)</p>
